_:b235_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "    - gs1:catchZone (FAO area codes) = locations for the trip during which the food was caught." .
_:b235_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "    - gs1:fishType = species / acceptable market name KDE." .
_:b235_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "    - gs1:harvestDateStart + gs1:harvestDateEnd = harvest date range KDE." .
_:b235_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  ObjectEvent, action=ADD, bizStep=creating_class_instance, disposition=active." .
_:b235_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  bizTransactionList = reference document type + number KDEs (cert, recadv, po)." .
_:b235_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  eventTime = date the food was landed (KDE)." .
_:b235_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  ilmd carries seafood-specific KDEs from the GS1 Web Vocabulary:" .
_:b235_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  quantityList.epcClass = newly assigned TLC (GTIN+Batch/Lot)." .
_:b235_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  readPoint = GLN of the first land-based receiver = TLC source (KDE)." .
_:b235_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "First Land-Based Receiver CTE per GS1 US 'EPCIS Recommendations for FSMA 204 CTEs' R2.0, §8." .
_:b235_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "NO usfsma: extension fields; all KDEs ride on native EPCIS / GS1 Web Vocabulary fields." .
_:b235_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Single ObjectEvent covers the entire CTE when the first land-based receiver assigns the TLC:" .
